	(text "Eight 3.3 V GPIO (MCU pins). Each: 4.7k series + BAT54S clamp to +3V3/GND on the MCU side,\nso a 24 V short draws ~4.5 mA and the pin stays inside its rails.\nJ40 SPTD double-level push-in: lower level = GPIO1-8, upper level = GND (one ground per channel)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
